      "message": "Fix various compilation issues with clang (#6259)\n\n- The last argument to MapTest is the default cost value, not the\nresolution\n- Many logging statements were incorrect\n- I've removed some unused lambda captures\n- std::sqrt is not constexpr until C++26 in clang\n- some float constants were bigger than what could be represented\n  without conversion loss\n\nSigned-off-by: Ramon Wijnands <ramon.wijnands@nobleo.nl>",
